{'symbol': 'WFC', 'date': '2022-04-25 12:48:00', 'title': 'WELLS FARGO RESPONSE TO PRESS CONFERENCE ON UNFOUNDED ALLEGATIONS', 'text': "SAN FRANCISCO--(BUSINESS WIRE)--WELLS FARGO & COMPANY (NYSE:WFC) TODAY ISSUED THE FOLLOWING STATEMENT RESPONDING TO COMMENTS MADE AT A PRESS CONFERENCE BY PLAINTIFFS' ATTORNEYS BEN CRUMP, LINDA FRIEDMAN, AND SUZANNE BISH. “WE ARE DEEPLY DISTURBED BY ALLEGATIONS OF DISCRIMINATION THAT WE BELIEVE DO NOT STAND UP TO SCRUTINY. WE ARE CONFIDENT THAT WE FOLLOW RELEVANT GOVERNMENT-SPONSORED ENTERPRISE (GSE) GUIDELINES IN OUR DECISION MAKING AND THAT OUR UNDERWRITING PRACTICES ARE CONSISTENTLY APPL"}